 course builds upon the differential calculus covered in Calculus I , providing in-depth coverage of integral calculus including integration techniques, applications of integration. Advanced topics such as series convergence tests, Taylor series, calculus with parametric and polar equations, and introductory differential equations are also covered. This comprehensive course will prepare students for further studies in advanced mathematics, engineering, statistics, machine learning, and other fields requiring a solid foundation in integral calculus." #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186046645 #edb/ref 1009 "Further your understanding of calculus: master advanced integration techniques, model real-world situations using differential equations, and more." #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186046645 #edb/ref 1012 106 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186046645 #edb/ref 1013 "CA2" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186046645 #edb/ref 1014 #uuid "4965f9cc-fd21-5d50-b441-6e80983b17dd" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186048116 #edb/ref 1027 #edb/ref 17592186048812 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186048116 #edb/ref 1027 #edb/ref 17592186049326 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186048116 #edb/ref 1028 #edb/ref 17592186083333 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186048116 #edb/ref 1028 #edb/ref 17592186083386 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186048116 #edb/ref 1031 "Revenue, Cost, and Profit Functions" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186048116 #edb/ref 1033 701 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186048116 #edb/ref 1035 #uuid "803c19d0-8753-5665-8041-67db4c272328" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186048162 #edb/ref 1027 #edb/ref 17592186048450 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186048162 #edb/ref 1027 #edb/ref 17592186048525 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186048162 #edb/ref 1027 #edb/ref 17592186048716 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186048162 #edb/ref 1027 #edb/ref 17592186048985 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186048162 #edb/ref 1027 #edb/ref 17592186050688 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186048162 #edb/ref 1027 #